{
  "_help": [
    "Every raw ingredient in the pantry. The food engine works out what happens when you cook them,",
    "using these properties, so you never have to write every combination by hand.",
    "id     : short unique name (lowercase, underscores).",
    "name   : what the player sees.   mod: the word used inside dish names ('Herb' Butter, 'Tomato' Soup).",
    "cat    : grain, dairy, egg, veg, fruit, herb, spice, sweet, fat, liquid, protein, nut, condiment, seasoning.",
    "form   : whole, powder, liquid, block, leaves, grains.",
    "taste  : 0 to 3 for sweet, salty, sour, bitter, umami, spicy, rich, fresh.",
    "flags  : medium (cooking water), juicy, starchy, raw (should be cooked), acid, leaven, fat, seasoning, sweetener, dairy, tea.",
    "weight : how much it counts in a dish (default 1; salt and spices count less).",
    "pack   : which pantry it belongs to. 'starter' is available from the beginning; the others unlock with chef ranks (see kitchen.json).",
    "art    : how the doodle is drawn (see js/shapes.js). Add  \"image\": \"art/items/name.png\"  to use your own picture."
  ],
